  "description": "Sponsorship OpportunitiesHighlander Robotics provides real-life STEM experiences through regional and national robotics competitions. As a community-based ",
  "bodyClass": "body-4",
  "body": "<h1 class=\"heading-11\"><br>Sponsorship Opportunities</h1><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-6 w-container\"><h3 class=\"sponsor-body-text\">Highlander Robotics provides real-life STEM experiences through regional and national robotics competitions. As a community-based team, we do not receive any funding from the school. Our team of student innovators relies on the support of <span class=\"text-span-22\">volunteers</span> and<span class=\"text-span-23\"> sponsors</span> to help offset expenses and provide the best program possible.<br></h3></div><section class=\"body-section\"><div class=\"section-child row\"><div class=\"text-cell _1\"><h2 class=\"heading-3 black\">Sponsorship Levels</h2><ul role=\"list\" class=\"list-7\"><li><strong>Ultra Violet ($10,000 and up)</strong><br>- Largest logo at banner top, robot, shirt, and website<br>- Name included in news coverage of the team<br>‍</li><li><strong>Purple ($5000 - $9,999)</strong><br>- Largest logo near banner top, robot, shirt, and website<br> - Name included in news coverage of the team<br>‍</li><li><strong>Gold ($2,500 - $4,999)</strong><br>- Large logo on banner, robot, shirt, &amp; website<br>‍</li><li><strong>Silver ($1,000 - $2,499)</strong><br>- Small logo on banner &amp; website<br>‍<br></li><li><strong>Bronze (&lt; $1,000)<br></strong> - Small logo on our website<br></li></ul></div><div class=\"row no-gap center\"><img src=\"/assets/12edd4cf174108c9-656fbfface08f2dc3bb8d9b1_T-shirt.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"sponsor-mockup\"><img src=\"/assets/ec1fc96685a02b47-656fbffa04a82a17962d3c11_Robot.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"sponsor-mockup\"></div></div></section><section class=\"body-section\"><div class=\"section-child\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors largest\"><h1 class=\"heading-35\">Our Sponsors</h1><h1 class=\"heading-59\">Practice Field Sponsors</h1><img src=\"/assets/04c58155053e8fea-695efb445a5a7493ab412e3a_pge-foundation.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"368\" alt=\"\" class=\"largest-sponsor\"><div class=\"sponsors\"><img src=\"/assets/f1e539387fe0bcbe-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"319\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 78vw, (max-width: 767px) 48vw, 319px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/609bed1aae85d883-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo-p-500.png 500w, /assets/b34ade0789a90074-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo-p-800.png 800w, /assets/ae1e9011047e15b3-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/f1e539387fe0bcbe-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo.png 1341w\" class=\"largest-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/430707adec8d7327-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"260\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 78vw, (max-width: 767px) 48vw, 260px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/fe5a7cc98645739b-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/fe4be653ac7e126c-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/3c0ecd32ce6bc8d2-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /assets/430707adec8d7327-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo.jpg 1200w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"sponsors\"><div class=\"text-block-33\">Alice Schultz In Memory of Bill Schultz</div><h1 class=\"heading-60\">Team Sponsors</h1></div><div class=\"sponsors\"><img src=\"/assets/0995973f7fe7441b-645845daa42c07f989d18caa_LLNS_LLC.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"145\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-56\"></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors large large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/680c8a76255e9c72-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"129\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 129px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/01c3cf49b375d977-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground-p-500.webp 500w, /assets/3db835d2ebe20dfb-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground-p-800.webp 800w, /assets/086188237990df99-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets/680c8a76255e9c72-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground.webp 1467w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/0837e8d07426c0a0-67560fb1a87b494f2bafd456_AptgarGroup__1_.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"190\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/eb58cca4c4aeebb3-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"235\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 48vw, 235px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/7862b9e606adaeda-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_-p-500.png 500w, /assets/7287ab2a72453549-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_-p-800.png 800w, /assets/b61acd66e7cd392d-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/eb58cca4c4aeebb3-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_.png 1897w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/d87e988474312bf9-695efab9a77e8d3081374624_google.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"199\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, 199px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/bb39bccc1daa4830-695efab9a77e8d3081374624_google-p-500.webp 500w, /assets/d87e988474312bf9-695efab9a77e8d3081374624_google.webp 1200w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors large large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/578f0118af7071c5-695efe0f247066f7ed349dda_olympusprop.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"191\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/9951fbba3df0b8fb-67842f8a9fab76d9865b436a_wcp_logo__1_.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"127\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/d2ce8709e9c130d9-699b8632cc65e8e93980feae_anatomiclogo.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"236\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/eec0c6a994116a38-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 116px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/7a999eb89d532c22-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/3d5b8298e351a38e-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/eec0c6a994116a38-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile.jpg 900w\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/4e5545478568b4ce-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 167px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/08a1ac3b1224442a-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB-p-500.png 500w, /assets/3924b7252546490f-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB-p-800.png 800w, /assets/4e5545478568b4ce-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB.png 1500w\" class=\"large-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors large large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/ff1c4d0f3d39e0a6-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 121px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/41f4aed2c52e49c2-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/52b98a7dc88c1b33-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/ff1c4d0f3d39e0a6-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM.png 938w\" class=\"small-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/10d09a095dad41d2-645845daec63771f6a19fa1e_Making_Fun.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"192\" alt=\"\" class=\"small-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors small\"></div></div></section><div class=\"div-block-31\"><img src=\"/assets/9b6129c22f4b21db-6549c783516affe6edc5e155_Screen_Shot_2023-11-06_at_9.13.21_PM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"450\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 450px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/9c52d6b9f19c78e8-6549c783516affe6edc5e155_Screen_Shot_2023-11-06_at_9.13.21_PM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/b6805e2b55eb7d7c-6549c783516affe6edc5e155_Screen_Shot_2023-11-06_at_9.13.21_PM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/74304213274c2197-6549c783516affe6edc5e155_Screen_Shot_2023-11-06_at_9.13.21_PM-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/9b6129c22f4b21db-6549c783516affe6edc5e155_Screen_Shot_2023-11-06_at_9.13.21_PM.png 1110w\" class=\"image-15\"><div class=\"div-block-32\"><div class=\"text-block-15 b\"><span class=\"text-span-18\"><strong>‍</strong></span><span class=\"text-span-15\"><strong><br></strong></span><span class=\"text-span-17\"><strong class=\"bold-text\">How To Become A Sponsor<br></strong></span><span class=\"text-span-15\"><strong>‍<br></strong></span><span class=\"text-span-20\">1. Click the button below that says Donate Now<br>2. Select the amount you would like to donate<br>3. Select \"Highlanders FRC\" from the drop down menu<br>4. Add your donation to the cart and pay</span></div><a href=\"https://donate.piedmontmakers.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button white w-button\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Donate Now</a></div></div><h2 class=\"heading-15\">Benefits of Supporting Highlander Robotics</h2><div id=\"w-node-_464e605a-9336-2369-5359-8e7079781fe2-7971759e\" class=\"w-layout-layout wf-layout-layout\"><div class=\"w-layout-cell text-cell\"><ul role=\"list\" class=\"list-6\"><li><strong>Our Mission</strong> - We started the first FRC team in our community!</li><li><strong>Advertising</strong> - Your corporate branding will be displayed on everything we wear - including our robot.</li><li>FIRST Robotics students are:<strong> 4x as likely</strong> to pursue a career in engineering.</li><li><strong>Supporting STEM</strong> - Investment in the team is an investment in future STEM leaders and innovators. </li><li>We made it to Worlds in Houston, Texas in 2022 and 2023!</li></ul></div><div class=\"w-layout-cell text-cell\"><ul role=\"list\" class=\"list-5\"><li><strong>Tax Benefits</strong> - <strong>We have 501(c)(3) status</strong> under Piedmont Makers, so donations to the team are <strong>tax deductible as a non-profit.</strong></li><li>Not only does participation on the team <strong>build technical skills</strong>, it <strong>also builds leadership, business, and communication skills</strong>, key abilities for future success: FIRST Robotics students are <strong>2x as likely to volunteer in their communities.</strong></li><li><strong>Visibility</strong> for your company at our regional and national competitions where <strong>thousands</strong> of people attend high-level robotics competitions.</li></ul></div></div>"
}